<title>USA: Key IMM currency futures end lower.</title>
<headline>Key IMM currency futures end lower.</headline>
<text>
<p>July 31 - IMM currency futures ended mixed, with marks, Swiss francs and yen all lower. Traders note one dealer bought 2,000 marks and sold 1,500 yen in last minutes of trade. &quot;The explosion was on the close,&quot; a floor trader said. He called late action an &quot;end-of-the-month type trade.&quot; Most of the afternoon had been quiet, traders said.</p>
